      - - '01:43:43   54244 WARNING EnvoyExt: LAYOUT WARNING: /project1/magical_visuals -- 2 ops stacked at (0,0): cam_look, nuke_light; 5 overlapping op pair(s). execute_python does NOT auto-position ops (create_op does); run get_network_layout and reposition per network-layout.md.'
      - - '01:43:43   54244 WARNING EnvoyExt: LAYOUT WARNING: /project1/magical_visuals/nikki_shrine -- 3 ops stacked at (0,0): torus1, shrine_attr, shrine_mesh; 3 overlapping op pair(s). execute_python does NOT auto-position ops (create_op does); run get_network_layout and reposition per network-layout.md.'
