  - name: PROJECT_LEGEND
    type: textDAT
    position: [-245, 432]
    size: [800, 300]
    color: [0.15, 0.15, 0.2]
    comment: Read me first â€” project guide for newcomers
    dat_content: "GRANDMASTER MELODIA â€” TOUCHDESIGNER PROJECT\n=====================================================\nBuilt for Environment Portfolio Platform (UE 5.8 + Blender 5.1)\n\nHOW TO USE THIS PROJECT:\n1. Look at the colored boxes below â€” each is a CONTAINER\n2. Double-click any container to enter its network\n3. Press SPACE to toggle between operator list and 3D view\n4. Middle-click any operator to see its live output\n5. Select any operator and press P for parameters\n6. Press H to home the camera on your geometry\n\nCONTAINER LEGEND:\n  AUDIO (purple)     â€” Melusina vocal analysis: pitch, amplitude, beat\n  SHADERS (dark purp)â€” GLSL shader prototypes (toon, satin, crystal)\n  POST-FX (orange)   â€” Nikki bloom chain: 3-pass Gaussian + LUT\n  PARTICLES (cyan)   â€” GPU particles: sparkles, ambient motes, burst \n  OSC (green)        â€” Open Sound Control: TD â†” Blender â†” Unreal\n  GEO (red)          â€” 3D models: FBX loader + camera + lighting\n  RENDER (gold)      â€” Final render output + stats overlay\n  UI (blue)          â€” Preset controls: style, day/night, audio gain\n  LEARN TD (gray)    â€” Tutorial + M.C. Escher geometry playground\n  EXPORT (lt green)  â€” Screenshot export to PNG\n\nQUICK START:\n  â†’ Double-click LEARN TD (gray box, far right)\n  â†’ Double-click any Escher piece (Penrose stairs, spiral, etc.)\n  â†’ Press SPACE to see 3D geometry\n  â†’ Press H to home the camera\n  â†’ Select any SOP node and press P â€” tune parameters live!\n\nYOUR PIPELINE:\n  Blender (SurrealArch) â†’ FBX export â†’ TD (SOPs + FX) â†’ OSC â†’ UE 5.8\n"
    dat_content_format: text
  - name: test_container
    type: containerCOMP
    position: [-685, -51]
    size: [160, 130]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
  - name: GraphManagerExt
    type: textDAT
    position: [1655, 348]
    size: [130, 90]
    color: [0.67, 0.67, 0.67]
    dat_content: "class GraphManagerExt:\n    def __init__(self, ownerComp):\n        self.ownerComp = ownerComp\n        \n    def FixWorldGen(self):\n        cam = op('/project1/worldgen/camera')\n        if cam:\n            cam.par.tx.expr = \"\"\n            cam.par.ty.expr = \"\"\n            cam.par.tz.expr = \"\"\n            cam.par.tx = 0\n            cam.par.ty = 0\n            cam.par.tz = 5\n            return \"Fixed worldgen camera Translate expression error.\"\n        return \"Target not found.\"\n\n    def WirePipeline(self):\n        # We will expose a method to fix connections safely\n        pass\n\n    def AutoLayout(self):\n        pass\n"
    dat_content_format: text
  - name: magical_visuals
    type: baseCOMP
    position: [434, -342]
    color: [0.05, 0.2, 0.5]
    children:
    - name: cam_look
      type: nullCOMP
      children:
      - name: primitive1
        type: primitivePOP
        parameters:
          method: pattern
        sequences:
          attr:
          - name: color
          prim:
          - type: lines
            pattern: 0 1
          - type: lines
            pattern: 2 3
          - type: lines
            pattern: 4 5
          pt:
          - posx: -0.1
            colorg: 0
            colorb: 0
          - posx: 0.1
            colorg: 0
            colorb: 0
